========================================================================
PHASE 4: New Features
========================================================================

[ ] 4.1 ZoomHack (sdk/Features/ZoomHack.h)
    - Camera chain: HudInstance -> +0x18 -> Camera -> +0x3D0 -> ZoomConfig -> +0x24/+0x28
    - Pure memory write - NO trampoline needed
    - Methods: SetZoom(), SetZoomLimits(), PatchZoomLimits() (safest)
    - SDK wrapper: SDK::ZoomHack::SetLimits(min, max)

[ ] 4.2 NavGrid Full API (core/CoreNavGrid.h + sdk/Core/NavGrid.h)
    - Cell-level IsWall/IsBrush/IsWater (su dung NavGridCellLayout)
    - Path collision check
    - World <-> Cell conversion (CellSize, MinX/MinZ, HalfCellSize)

[ ] 4.3 DirectInput (core/CoreInput.h)
    - vtable hook for keyboard/mouse (VT_GetDeviceData = 0x50)
    - Input inject/filter capability
    - Device ptrs: KB=0x1E68BF8, Mouse=0x1E68C00

[ ] 4.4 ModSkin (sdk/Features/ModSkin.h)
    - Read: SkinNetID, SkinName, ModelName, SkinChangeFlag
    - Write: SkinParam1/SkinParam2 (method 1, no trampoline)
    - Full reload: call sub_DA1740 (method 2, NEEDS trampoline)

